      "instance_name": "terrorism_associations",
      "label": "Terrorism Associations",
      "description": "This is a stereotype often used in Islamophobia to associate Muslims or people with Muslim-sounding names with terrorism. The meme leverages this stereotype by implying that Ahmed Mohamed, whose name is common among Muslims, is connected to bomb-making, which is a dangerous and false association.",
