      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "Ahmed Mohamed is mapped onto the child tinkering with science equipment",
      "description": "The text 'ahmed mohamed reminds us' is juxtaposed with the visual of a child tinkering with scientific equipment. This creates an analogical mapping where the child is implicitly identified as 'Ahmed Mohamed', and the act of tinkering is falsely mapped onto the context of bomb-making, as suggested by the text. The mapping is harmful and misleading, exploiting the real-life incident involving Ahmed Mohamed to associate him with terrorism.",
