      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual message",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'ahmed mohamed reminds us to set our bombs 1 hour ahead this weekend', which directly addresses the viewer with an imperative ('reminds us') and a call to action ('set our bombs'). This creates an implicit 'you' projection, where the viewer is positioned as the one who must heed the warning, thereby making the user an active participant in the meme's harmful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
